000100* @file fixture.cbl
000110* @brief COBOL-60 golden fixture with REMARKS, NOTE, & EXAMINE.
000120* @module LEDGER60
000130* @details CODASYL 1960 fixed-format UDT and EXAMINE serde.
000140 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000150 PROGRAM-ID. LEDGER60.
000160 REMARKS. HISTORICAL CODASYL 1960 LEDGER RECORD.
000170 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000180 DATA DIVISION.
000190 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000200* @record LEDGER-REC Root ledger record.
000210 01  LEDGER-REC.                                                  C60G0001
000220* @field ACCT-NO Account number.
000230     05  ACCT-NO               PICTURE IS 9(9).                   C60G0001
000240* @field ACCT-NAME Account holder name.
000250     05  ACCT-NAME             PICTURE IS X(20).                  C60G0001
000260* @subprogram LEDGER60 Execute COBOL-60 serde section.
000270* @return Populated ledger state.
000280* @errors None.
000290 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000300* @section LEDGER-TO-JSON Serialize ledger in COBOL-60.
000310 LEDGER-TO-JSON SECTION.
000320* @paragraph P-SER Serialize paragraph with NOTE and EXAMINE.
000330 P-SER.
000340     NOTE SERIALIZE LEDGER FIELDS USING EXAMINE.
000350     EXAMINE ACCT-NAME REPLACING ALL LOW-VALUES BY SPACES.
000360     STOP RUN.
